From: Surface Go Gaming OS
Subject: [PATCH] Default first SDL gamepad with keyboard fallback and preserve profiles

Upstream SDLGamepad names and the bundled SDL Gamepad profile are used
verbatim. Select the real ciface qualifier, not SDL instance IDs. Publish
new defaults without replacing any existing configuration.

